; Build-time configurator. Probes the environment for Hexaly, picks
; backend, and emits dune (:include) sexp files + a one-line
; hexaly_shim.cpp that selects real or mock.
;
; This replaces the previous configure.sh — it's plain OCaml and runs on
; every platform OCaml runs on (Linux, macOS, Windows, *BSD).

(executable
 (name discover)
 (libraries dune-configurator))
